OL,3,GNEWSAFire breaks out at proposed asylum
OL,4,Aseeker housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have been battling a blaze
OL,7,Fat an empty building earmarked for use
OL,8,Fas asylum seeker accommodation.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fwas called to Roman Court, a former
OL,12,Fsheltered housing complex in
OL,13,FLeverington, at 19:26 BST on Wednesday.
OL,15,FThe fire service said six crews were
OL,16,F"working hard" to tackle the blaze and
OL,17,Fprevent it from spreading.
OL,19,FAn investigation will be carried out to
OL,20,Festablish the cause of the fire once it
OL,21,Fis fully extinguished, it said.
